Project Overview

The Customer Support Ticket Automation system streamlines complaint handling by automating ticket intake, categorisation and customer communication. Built with n8n, the workflow captures customer information through a webhook, routes complaints according to their categories, evaluates the urgency of payment-related issues and sends automated email acknowledgements.
The solution helps businesses reduce repetitive support tasks, improve complaint organisation and provide customers with timely responses, while enabling support teams to manage enquiries more efficiently.
